## smem-store-scene.soar -- object-world: 1 elaboration.

## Elaborate store-scene smem recur -> sets store.
## Recursive store all substructure including objects
sp {object-world*elaborate*store-scene*smem*recur
   :default
   (state <s> ^smem.command <cmd>)
   (<cmd> ^store <something>)
   (<something> ^{ <> duplicate-of <> info <> future-event <> derived-from-input <attr>}
                   { <=> <cmd> <child-that-is-sym>}) # (same type as something you know is a symbol, not a constant)
  -(<child-that-is-sym> ^smem-stored true)
-->
   (<cmd> ^store <child-that-is-sym>)
   (log 1  |@|)
}
